<title>NEW ZEALAND: ERGO sets NZ floating mortgage rate at 9.9 pct.</title>
<headline>ERGO sets NZ floating mortgage rate at 9.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>AMP Society's telephone banking subsidiary Ergo announced on Monday a floating mortgage rate of 9.9 percent.  </p>
<p>&quot;The new 9.90 percent floating mortgage rate reflects the current fall in wholesale rates,&quot; Ergo said in a statement.</p>
<p>The new floating rate would take effect for new business immediately and for existing business from January 31, 1997.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
